    "FLAT ROOF NOT USED AS AMENITY SPACE (COMPLIANCE):  The flat roof area to the front of the roof extension shown on plan no. 1413 A03 Rev 5 hereby approved shall not be used as an amenity or sitting out space of any kind whatsoever and shall not be used other than for essential maintenance or repair, or escape in case of emergency. The front parapet shall not be raised and no balustrading, railings or fencing shall be affixed to it. \r\n\r\nREASON: In order to avoid visible alterations to the appearance of the front of the property when viewed from the street, in line with the gudiance set out in Islington's Urband Design Guide (2017)."
